{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique heroes and build a deck of 15 monsters, ranked from 1\u2605 to 5\u2605, to destroy your opponent\u2019s towers first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own strategy using powerful heroes and 3\u2605\u20135\u2605 monsters, each equipped with their own special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck will be loaded randomly into the selection window, keeping every match fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy units with your allied monsters to collect mana and summon more from your deck. At the same time, charge your hero gauge to join the battlefield yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your hero gauge reaches 100%, dive into the fight alongside your monsters and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through your opponent\u2019s defenses, destroy more towers, and claim victory!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947220?t=1761133799","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947220?t=1761133799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947220/ff1520f6e3d34ce071d6313be6d1a0c0f585227f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761133799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947220/ff1520f6e3d34ce071d6313be6d1a0c0f585227f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761133799","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of unique heroes and build a deck of 15 monsters, ranked from 1\u2605 to 5\u2605, to destroy your opponent\u2019s towers first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your own strategy using powerful heroes and 3\u2605\u20135\u2605 monsters, each equipped with their own special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck will be loaded randomly into the selection window, keeping every match fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy units with your allied monsters to collect mana and summon more from your deck. At the same time, charge your hero gauge to join the battlefield yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your hero gauge reaches 100%, dive into the fight alongside your monsters and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through your opponent\u2019s defenses, destroy more towers, and claim victory!</p>","developers":["rr95studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947220/bc92be8b6a8b5a3823c2c972f9170cb1afb499ec/header.jpg?t=1761133799","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3947220/1359309284/d3ab26ee74fa0b8675b4e5aa153089c1c2a32054/1759484162/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760999850","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3947220/1359309284/d3ab26ee74fa0b8675b4e5aa153089c1c2a32054/1759484162/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760999850","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akama